    "image_text_JPraVG": {
      "type": "image_text",
      "blocks": {
        "bl_text_eQKCzJ": {
          "type": "bl_text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": false,
            "smaller_text": false,
            "col_dk": "9",
            "col_tb": "12",
            "text_size": "40,15",
            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h2>Without these people, Ahinsa shoes would have never existed<\/h2><p><strong>Vishwaguru Paramhans Svámí Mahéšvaránanda<\/strong><\/p><p>A master of yoga. His teachings on love and non-violence are based on traditional Eastern wisdom, but adapted to today’s way of life. He is the founder of the Yoga in Daily Life system, which links Eastern tradition with the knowledge of Western physicians and physiotherapists.<\/p><p><strong>Physiotherapist Clara Lewitová<\/strong><\/p><p>A recognized expert who is debunking many of the dogmatic practices of rehabilitation. She teaches a new approach that observes the patient without using constrictive traditional methods. She is the daughter of Prof. MUDr. Karel Lewit, one of the founders of the Prague School of Rehabilitation.<\/p><p><strong>Nina and Tomáš Klimpera<\/strong><\/p><p>Lukáš’s parents, who have always said: “Fortune favors the brave.” That’s why our founder wasn’t afraid to take matters into his own hands. Their lifelong diligence and hard-working nature are still an inspiration to him today.<\/p><p><strong>Lukáš Klimpera’s patients<\/strong><\/p><p>It was their needs that led Lukáš on his search for a healthy stride.<\/p>",
            "subhd_color": "#222222",
            "hd_color": "#222222",
            "des_color": "#202020",
            "use_shadow": false,
            "button_label": "Button label",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "default"
          }
        }
      },
