    "image_text_f4gtKp": {
      "type": "image_text",
      "blocks": {
        "bl_text_QFR6Gw": {
          "type": "bl_text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": false,
            "smaller_text": false,
            "col_dk": "6",
            "col_tb": "6",
            "text_size": "40,15",
            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h3>The first pair was made for his son<\/h3><p>As a physiotherapist, Lukáš used to teach people how to walk healthily. But what was the use? After therapy they slipped back into shoes that constricted them and hindered their natural movement.<\/p><p>That's why <strong>he set out to find better footwear<\/strong> – for them, for himself and for his family. But he couldn't find <strong>shoes that were all of these at once<\/strong>:<\/p><p>• healthy<br\/>• high-quality<br\/>• cruelty-free to people and animals<\/p><p>But he didn't give up. He discovered <strong>high-quality European materials<\/strong>, tested them and researched them. This is how the <strong>first pair of Ahinsa shoes was made<\/strong>. Healthy sandals for Lukáš's then 3-year-old son.<\/p>",
            "subhd_color": "#222222",
            "hd_color": "#222222",
            "des_color": "#202020",
            "use_shadow": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
