        "bl_text_QM7mQC": {
          "type": "bl_text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": false,
            "smaller_text": false,
            "col_dk": "6",
            "col_tb": "6",
            "text_size": "40,15",
            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h3>The beginning was rough<\/h3><p><strong>Our first shoe-making machines were old enough to remember Baťa<\/strong>, and a friend of ours even welded one together by hand for us. Negotiating with suppliers was also tough.<\/p><p>“Of course we'll deliver our material to you,” they said to Lukáš as a newcomer, “you'll just have to buy a kilometer of it.” And so a kilometer of excellent material made its way to our tiny workshop in Moravia, where we slowly began to cut from it to make our first shoes.<\/p><p>And it was worth it. Today we <strong>make shoes for the whole world<\/strong> and thanks to us, thousands of people are walking healthily.<\/p>",
            "subhd_color": "#222222",
            "hd_color": "#222222",
            "des_color": "#202020",
            "use_shadow": false,
            "button_label": "",
