            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h3>Why barefoot?<\/h3><h4>Because it's the most natural way to walk<\/h4><p>Nature has made our feet pliant and strong – all we have to do is rebound. That's why we make shoes that respect nature's work. <strong>Light, flexible barefoot shoes<\/strong> with enough space for a natural rebound.<\/p><p>• They stimulate brain centers.<br\/>• They activate long muscle chains that pass through the whole body.<br\/>• They strengthen the deep stabilization system.<\/p><p>Free your feet. Put on a pair of Ahinsa barefoot shoes.<\/p>",
            "subhd_color": "#222222",
            "hd_color": "#222222",
            "des_color": "#202020",
            "use_shadow": false,
