            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h3>The Comfort line – for those who want to walk with ease<\/h3><p>You might be looking for <strong>healthy and comfortable shoes<\/strong>, but don't want to get used to barefoot walking. That's why we've created the Comfort line just for you.<\/p><p>The Comfort line provides your feet with enough space for natural movement, while double cushioning <strong>softens your every step<\/strong>.<\/p><p>• The shoes will fit you the first time you try them on – no “breaking in”.<br\/>• You'll forget that blisters and callouses even exist.<br\/>• You'll learn to have a healthy and natural step.<\/p>",
            "subhd_color": "#222222",
            "hd_color": "#222222",
