            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h3>Ahinsa shoes are made with love in Europe<\/h3><p>Our Croatian colleagues make each pair <strong>by hand and with love<\/strong>. <strong>Their family has worked in the shoemaking craft for decades<\/strong>, and that’s why we’re grateful they took on Ahinsa shoes. At the beginning of 2025, they were joined by skilled shoemakers from Slovakia.<\/p><p>Thanks to them, you know your shoes were created ethically in Europe and will accompany you throughout the world.<\/p>",
